---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const BASE = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

// Derek-Sivers /now convention: what I am focused on right now. Updated
// every quarter at most. Replace the whole list when the focus shifts —
// no archive.
const updated = '2026-05-16';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Now"
  description="What I am focused on right now."
  lede={`Quarterly /now in the Sivers tradition. Last updated ${updated}.`}
  nav="home"
>
  <section class="prose">
    <h2>Building</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/nomi">Nomi</a> — local-first AI coding agent.
        Plan review before execution, capability-gated tools, BYO LLM. Tauri desktop + Go daemon.
        Your repo never leaves the laptop.
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/roady">Roady</a> — plan-of-record for AI coding agents.
        v0.12 just shipped: nested sub-projects, live Kanban, cross-project board, drag-and-drop,
        SSE updates, auth gate.
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/tokenops">TokenOps</a> — local daemon measuring
        LLM spend, rate-limit headroom across Claude Max / ChatGPT / Copilot / Cursor, and
        output-side prompt patterns.
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/scout">Scout</a> — browser automation in one Go
        binary. Simpler alternative to Playwright; library, CLI, MCP server, chat UI.
      </li>
      <li>
        Cognitive stack &mdash;
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/mnemos">mnemos</a> (evidence + memory),
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/chronos">chronos</a> (time/pattern perception),
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/nous">nous</a> (commitment extraction),
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/praxis">praxis</a> (typed action layer),
        <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/olymp">olymp</a> (runtime / control plane).
        Domain-agnostic Go pieces an agent runtime composes.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Writing on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Operating-model debt — why three weeks looks identical to a year until it does not.</li>
      <li>Error-budget discipline at platform scale.</li>
      <li>Notes around operations, product, engineering, and how teams collaborate.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Reading</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Team Topologies (re-read).</li>
      <li>The Goal (Goldratt) — flow-not-utilisation reframe.</li>
      <li>Click.</li>
      <li>Vibe Coding.</li>
      <li>Rethinking operating models.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="muted">
      <em>Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">nownownow.com</a>.</em>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
